| path state | actual signed permutation | breakpoints | lower bound |
| ---: | --- | ---: | ---: |
| 0 | `[-2, -1]` | 2 | 1 |
| 1 | `[1, 2]` | 0 | 0 |
\image(figures/signed_reversals_tiny.svg)
