| 1 | [0,4] | `[-4, 5, -2, -1, -3]` | 5 |
| 2 | [0,0] | `[4, 5, -2, -1, -3]` | 4 |
| 3 | [0,3] | `[1, 2, -5, -4, -3]` | 2 |
| 4 | [2,4] | `[1, 2, 3, 4, 5]` | 0 |

Exact distance 4; actual states 2010; generated edges 7332. Root reversal [-1,-1] is a marker.
